#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:51
msgid "Shape Selection Tool"
msgstr "Nástroj výberu tvarov"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:53
msgid "|toolshapeselection|"
msgstr "|toolshapeselection|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:55
msgid ""
"The shape selection tool used to be called the \"default\" tool. This had to "
"do with Krita being part of an office suite once upon a time. But this is no "
"longer the case, so we renamed it to its purpose in Krita: Selecting shapes! "
"This tool only works on vector layers, so trying to use it on a paint layer "
"will give a notification."
msgstr ""
"Nástroj výberu tvarov sa kedysi nazýval \"predvolený\" nástroj. Súviselo to "
"s tým, že Krita bola kedysi súčasťou kancelárskeho balíka. To už však "
"neplatí, takže sme ho premenovali podľa jeho účelu v Krite: Výber tvarov! "
"Tento nástroj funguje iba na vektorových vrstvách; pokus o jeho použitie na "
"malerickej vrstve zobrazí upozornenie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:57
msgid ""
"After you create vector shapes, you can use this tool to select, transform, "
"and access the shape's options in the tool options docker. There are a lot "
"of different properties and things you can do with each vector shape. If you "
"have text shapes selected, you can edit their properties with the :ref:"
"`text_properties_docker`, see :ref:`shape_selection_tool_text` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Po vytvorení vektorových tvarov môžete tento nástroj použiť na výber, "
"transformáciu a prístup k možnostiam tvarov v dokeri možností nástroja. "
"Každý vektorový tvar má veľa rôznych vlastností a možností. Ak máte vybrané "
"textové tvary, ich vlastnosti môžete upravovať pomocou :ref:"
"`text_properties_docker`; viac informácií nájdete v časti :ref:"
"`shape_selection_tool_text`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:60
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Výber"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:61
msgid "Selecting shapes can be done by three types of actions:"
msgstr "Výber tvarov je možné vykonať tromi typmi akcií:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:63
msgid "|mouseleft| on a single shape to select it."
msgstr "|mouseleft| na jeden tvar ho vyberie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:64
msgid "|mouseleft| and drag to select multiple shapes."
msgstr "|mouseleft| a ťahanie vyberie viacero tvarov."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:66
msgid ""
"*Blue selection* (drag left to right): selects only shapes fully covered."
msgstr ""
"*Modrý výber* (ťahanie zľava doprava): vyberie len tvary úplne pokryté."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:67
msgid "*Green selection* (drag right to left): selects all the touched shapes."
msgstr "*Zelený výber* (ťahanie sprava doľava): vyberie všetky dotknuté tvary."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:68
msgid ""
"Press :kbd:`Shift` key while |mouseleft| to add or remove a shape from "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Stlačte kláves :kbd:`Shift` pri |mouseleft|, čím pridáte alebo odoberiete "
"tvar z výberu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:74
msgid "Left: Blue selection. Right: Green selection."
msgstr "Vľavo: Modrý výber. Vpravo: Zelený výber."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:74
msgid ".. image:: /images/tools/blue-and-green-selections.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/tools/blue-and-green-selections.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:74
msgid ""
"Blue selection: left-to-right, selects fully covered images. --  Green "
"selection: right-to-left, selects touched shapes."
msgstr ""
"Modrý výber: zľava doprava, vyberie úplne pokryté obrázky. --  Zelený výber: "
"sprava doľava, vyberie dotknuté tvary."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:79
msgid ""
"*Selecting multiple shapes is only possible for shapes within the same "
"Vector Layer*"
msgstr ""
"*Výber viacerých tvarov je možný len pre tvary v rámci tej istej vektorovej "
"vrstvy*"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:83
msgid "Placement, Scale, Angle and Distortion"
msgstr "Umiestnenie, mierka, uhol a skreslenie"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:85
msgid ""
"Once an object is selected, a dashed bounding box will appear around it. The "
"box will also have square handles. You can use this bounding box to do "
"adjust: placement, scale, angle and distortion of the selected object."
msgstr ""
"Po výbere objektu sa okolo neho zobrazí prerušovaný ohraničujúci rámček. "
"Rámček bude mať aj štvorcové úchyty. Tento ohraničujúci rámček môžete použiť "
"na úpravu: umiestnenia, mierky, uhla a skreslenia vybraného objektu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:91
msgid "Left to right: Placement, Scale, Angle and Distortion."
msgstr "Zľava doprava: Umiestnenie, mierka, uhol a skreslenie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:91
msgid ".. image:: /images/tools/shapes-selection-properties.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/tools/shapes-selection-properties.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:94
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| and hold inside the bounding box, while holding move the shape "
"to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| a podržanie vo vnútri ohraničujúceho rámčeka; počas podržania "
"presuňte tvar na požadovanú pozíciu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:98
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "Umiestnenie"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:98
msgid ""
"You can lock movement to the vertical or horizontal axis: hold |mouseleft| "
"and then press :kbd:`Shift` key while moving."
msgstr ""
"Pohyb môžete uzamknúť na zvislú alebo vodorovnú os: podržte |mouseleft| a "
"potom počas pohybu stlačte kláves :kbd:`Shift`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:101
msgid ""
"|mouseleft| and hold inside any of the square handles, move to adjust the "
"dimensions of the object."
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| a podržanie na ktoromkoľvek zo štvorcových úchytov; pohybom "
"upravíte rozmery objektu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:105
msgid ""
"You can lock width/height ratio when resizing the shape: hold |mouseleft| "
"and then press :kbd:`Shift` while resizing."
msgstr ""
"Pomer šírky a výšky môžete uzamknúť pri zmene veľkosti tvaru: podržte |"
"mouseleft| a potom počas zmeny veľkosti stlačte :kbd:`Shift`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:107
msgid ""
"You can resize around the shape center: hold |mouseleft| and then press :kbd:"
"`Ctrl` while resizing."
msgstr ""
"Zmenu veľkosti môžete vykonať okolo stredu tvaru: podržte |mouseleft| a "
"potom počas zmeny veľkosti stlačte :kbd:`Ctrl`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:109
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "Mierka"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:109
msgid "Combination of :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift` is possible."
msgstr "Kombinácia :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift` je možná."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:112
msgid ""
"Place the cursor slightly outside any of the corner handles. |mouseleft| and "
"drag to adjust the angle of the shape."
msgstr ""
"|mouseleft| a ťahajte tesne mimo ktoréhokoľvek rohového úchytu na úpravu "
"uhla tvaru."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:116
msgid "Angle"
msgstr "Uhol"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:116
msgid ""
"You can constrain rotation to 45°: hold |mouseleft| and then press :kbd:"
"`Ctrl` while rotating."
msgstr ""
"Otáčanie môžete obmedziť na 45°: podržte |mouseleft| a potom počas otáčania "
"stlačte :kbd:`Ctrl`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:119
msgid ""
"Place the cursor slightly outside any of the middle handles. |mouseleft| and "
"drag to skew the shape."
msgstr ""
"Umiestnite kurzor tesne mimo ktoréhokoľvek stredného úchytu. |mouseleft| a "
"ťahajte na skreslenie tvaru."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:121
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "Skreslenie"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:124
msgid "Tool Options"
msgstr "Možnosti nástroja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:126
msgid ""
"The tool options of this menu are quite involved, and separated over 3 tabs."
msgstr "Možnosti tohto nástroja sú pomerne rozsiahle a rozdelené do 3 kariet."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:130
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Geometria"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:136
msgid "Geometry is the first section in the tool options."
msgstr "Geometria je prvou sekciou v možnostiach nástroja."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:140
msgid ""
"Position of a shape is defined by :guilabel:`X` and :guilabel:`Y` "
"coordinates."
msgstr "Poloha tvaru je definovaná súradnicami :guilabel:`X` a :guilabel:`Y`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:144
msgid ""
"Also, the origin of position (top-left, middle, bottom-right, ...) is "
"defined by the active button:"
msgstr ""
"Počiatok polohy (vľavo hore, uprostred, vpravo dole, ...) je tiež definovaný "
"aktívnym tlačidlom:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:148
msgid ""
"Provided position coordinates are always relative to the origin: if the "
"origin is modified, :guilabel:`X` and :guilabel:`Y` coordinates are updated "
"by consequence."
msgstr ""
"Zadané súradnice polohy sú vždy relatívne k počiatku: ak sa počiatok zmení, "
"súradnice :guilabel:`X` a :guilabel:`Y` sa zodpovedajúcim spôsobom "
"aktualizujú."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:153
msgid ""
"You can also use :ref:`Docker Arrange <arrange_docker>` tools to easily:"
msgstr ""
"Môžete tiež použiť nástroje :ref:`Docker Arrange <arrange_docker>` na "
"jednoduché:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:155
msgid "Align shapes"
msgstr "Zarovnať tvary"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:156
msgid "Distribute shapes"
msgstr "Rozmiestniť tvary"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:157
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Pozícia"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:157
msgid "Normalize distances between shapes"
msgstr "Normalizovať vzdialenosti medzi tvarmi"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:160
msgid "Size of a shape is defined by its width and height."
msgstr "Veľkosť tvaru je definovaná jeho šírkou a výškou."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:166
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Veľkosť"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:169
msgid "Enabled: when scaling, it will scale the stroke width with the shape."
msgstr "Povolené: pri škálovaní sa šírka ťahu bude škálovať spolu s tvarom."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:171
msgid "Scale Styles"
msgstr "Štýly mierky"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:171
msgid "Not enabled: when scaling, the stroke width will stay the same."
msgstr "Nepovolené: pri škálovaní šírka ťahu zostane nezmenená."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:174
msgid "Global coordinates"
msgstr "Globálne súradnice"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:174
msgid ""
"Determines whether the width and height bars use the width and height of the "
"object, while taking transforms into account."
msgstr ""
"Určuje, či lišty šírky a výšky používajú šírku a výšku objektu s ohľadom na "
"transformácie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:177
msgid ""
"Like there's a *Z-Order* for painting shapes, there's also an order to "
"render shape elements (Fill, Stroke, Markers)."
msgstr ""
"Podobne ako existuje *Z-Order* pre kreslenie tvarov, existuje aj poradie "
"vykresľovania prvkov tvaru (Fill, Stroke, Markers)."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:179
msgid "Which element is drawn first can change the final look of the shape."
msgstr ""
"To, ktorý prvok sa nakreslí ako prvý, môže zmeniť výsledný vzhľad tvaru."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:181
msgid "A polygon, solid Red fill, Blue 25px solid stroke, Blue bullet markers"
msgstr ""
"Polygón, plné červené výplne, modrý 25px plný ťah, modré bodkové značky"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:187
msgid "|icon_paintorder-fsm| Fill, Stroke, Markers"
msgstr "|icon_paintorder-fsm| Fill, Stroke, Markers"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:187
msgid "|icon_paintorder-sfm| Stroke, Fill, Markers"
msgstr "|icon_paintorder-sfm| Stroke, Fill, Markers"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:187
msgid "|icon_paintorder-fsm| Markers, Stroke, Fill"
msgstr "|icon_paintorder-fsm| Markers, Stroke, Fill"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:189
msgid "Fill, Stroke, Markers"
msgstr "Fill, Stroke, Markers"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:192
#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:286
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Nepriehľadnosť"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:192
msgid ""
"The general opacity, or transparency, of the object. Opacity for stroke and "
"fill are explained in the next two sections."
msgstr ""
"Celková nepriehľadnosť alebo priehľadnosť objektu. Nepriehľadnosť pre ťah a "
"výplň sú vysvetlené v nasledujúcich dvoch sekciách."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:196
msgid ""
"As Anchor Lock is not implemented at the moment, this checkbox is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Keďže Anchor Lock momentálne nie je implementovaný, toto zaškrtávacie "
"políčko je zakázané."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:200
msgid "Stroke"
msgstr "Ťah"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:206
msgid "The stroke tab determines how the stroke around the object should look."
msgstr "Záložka ťahu určuje, ako má vyzerať ťah okolo objektu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:208
msgid ""
"The first set of buttons allows us to set the fill of the stroke: *None*, "
"*Color* and *Gradient*; the same options exist for the fill of the shape, "
"please refer to the following \"**Fill**\" section for more details on how "
"to use both of them."
msgstr ""
"Prvá sada tlačidiel umožňuje nastaviť výplň ťahu: *None*, *Color* a "
"*Gradient*; rovnaké možnosti existujú pre výplň tvaru, podrobnosti nájdete v "
"nasledujúcej časti „**Fill**\"."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:210
msgid "Then, there are the settings for the stroke style:"
msgstr "Ďalej nasledujú nastavenia štýlu ťahu:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:213
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "Hrúbka"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:213
msgid ""
"Sets the width of the stroke. When creating a shape, Krita will use the "
"current brush size to determine the width of the stroke."
msgstr ""
"Nastavuje šírku ťahu. Pri vytváraní tvaru použije Krita aktuálnu veľkosť "
"štetca na určenie šírky ťahu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:216
msgid ""
"Line Cap defines how the ends of a stroke are drawn, while Line Corner "
"defines how segments joins (from a polyline or polygon) are drawn."
msgstr ""
"Line Cap definuje, ako sú nakreslené konce ťahu, pričom Line Corner "
"definuje, ako sú nakreslené spojenia segmentov (z polylínie alebo polygónu)."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:218
msgid ""
"Options can be accessed by pressing the three dots button next to the "
"thickness entry."
msgstr ""
"Možnosti sú dostupné po stlačení tlačidla s tromi bodkami vedľa poľa hrúbky."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:220
msgid "Possible Cap values:"
msgstr "Možné hodnoty Cap:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:222
msgid "|icon_strokecap-butt| Butt"
msgstr "|icon_strokecap-butt| Butt"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:223
msgid "|icon_strokecap-round| Round"
msgstr "|icon_strokecap-round| Round"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:224
msgid "|icon_strokecap-square| Square"
msgstr "|icon_strokecap-square| Square"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:228
msgid ""
"Difference between cap values on 25px thickness lines: Butt, Round and Square"
msgstr ""
"Rozdiel medzi hodnotami cap na líniách s hrúbkou 25 px: Butt, Round a Square"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:230
msgid "Possible Corner values:"
msgstr "Možné hodnoty Corner:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:232
msgid "|icon_strokejoin-bevel| Bevel"
msgstr "|icon_strokejoin-bevel| Bevel"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:233
msgid "|icon_strokejoin-miter| Miter"
msgstr "|icon_strokejoin-miter| Miter"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:234
msgid "|icon_strokejoin-round| Round"
msgstr "|icon_strokejoin-round| Round"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:236
msgid "|img_strokejoin-bevel| |img_strokejoin-miter| |img_strokejoin-round|"
msgstr "|img_strokejoin-bevel| |img_strokejoin-miter| |img_strokejoin-round|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:238
msgid ""
"*Difference between corner values on 25px thickness rectangle: Bevel, Miter "
"and Round*"
msgstr ""
"*Rozdiel medzi hodnotami corner na obdĺžniku s hrúbkou 25 px: Bevel, Miter a "
"Round*"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:239
msgid "Cap and corner style"
msgstr "Štýl Cap a Corner"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:242
msgid ""
"Sets the line style of the stroke: *solid*, *dashes*, *dots*, or mixes of "
"*dashes and dots*."
msgstr ""
"Nastavuje štýl čiary ťahu: *solid*, *dashes*, *dots* alebo kombinácie "
"*dashes and dots*."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:245
msgid "Line-style"
msgstr "Štýl čiary"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:248
msgid ""
"Adds markers to the stroke. Markers are little figures that will appear at "
"the start, end or all the nodes in between, depending on your configuration."
msgstr ""
"Pridáva značky k ťahu. Značky sú malé obrazce, ktoré sa zobrazia na "
"začiatku, konci alebo na všetkých uzloch medzi nimi, v závislosti od vašej "
"konfigurácie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:249
msgid "Markers"
msgstr "Označníky"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:252
msgid "Fill"
msgstr "Výplň"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:257
msgid ""
"This section is about the color that fills the shape. As mentioned above in "
"the **Stroke** section, the features are the same for both the fill of the "
"stroke and the fill of the shape. Here is the explanation for both:"
msgstr ""
"Táto sekcia sa týka farby, ktorá vypĺňa tvar. Ako bolo uvedené vyššie v "
"časti **Stroke**, funkcie sú rovnaké pre výplň ťahu aj výplň tvaru. Tu je "
"vysvetlenie pre obe:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:259
msgid "A fill can be: *solid color*, *gradient*, or *none* (transparent)"
msgstr "Výplň môže byť: *solid color*, *gradient* alebo *none* (priehľadná)"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:262
msgid "None"
msgstr "Žiadne"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:262
msgid "No fill. It's transparent."
msgstr "Bez výplne. Je priehľadná."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:265
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Farba"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:265
msgid "A flat color, you can select a new one by pressing the color button."
msgstr "Jednoliatá farba, novú môžete vybrať stlačením tlačidla farby."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:268
msgid ""
"As the name implies this type fills the shape with a gradient. It has the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
"Ako názov napovedá, tento typ vypĺňa tvar prechodom. Má nasledujúce možnosti:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:270
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:271
msgid "A linear or radial gradient."
msgstr "Lineárny alebo radiálny prechod."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:272
msgid "Repeat"
msgstr "Opakovanie"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:273
msgid "How the gradient repeats itself."
msgstr "Ako sa prechod opakuje."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:274
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Predvolené"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:275
msgid ""
"A menu for selecting a base gradient from a set of predefined gradient "
"presets, which can be edited as desired."
msgstr ""
"Ponuka na výber základného prechodu zo sady preddefinovaných predvolieb "
"prechodu, ktoré možno podľa potreby upraviť."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:276
msgid "Save Gradient"
msgstr "Uložiť prechod"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:277
msgid "A quick way for saving the current gradient as a preset."
msgstr "Rýchly spôsob uloženia aktuálneho prechodu ako predvoľby."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:279
msgid "Stops Options Line"
msgstr "Možnosti nástroja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:279
msgid ""
"A representation of how the gradient colors should look. The stops are "
"represented by triangles. There are two stops by default one at the "
"beginning and one at the end. You can create more stops just by clicking "
"anywhere on the line. To select a stop |mouseleft| inside the triangle. To "
"delete the stops, |mouseleft| drag them to left or right until the end of "
"the line."
msgstr ""
"Znázornenie toho, ako by mali vyzerať farby prechodu. Zastavenia sú "
"znázornené trojuholníkmi. Štandardne sú dve zastavenia – jedno na začiatku a "
"jedno na konci. Ďalšie zastavenia môžete vytvoriť kliknutím kdekoľvek na "
"čiare. Na výber zastavenia |mouseleft| kliknite dovnútra trojuholníka. Na "
"vymazanie zastavení ich |mouseleft| potiahnite doľava alebo doprava až na "
"koniec čiary."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:281
msgid "Flip Gradient"
msgstr "Prechod"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:282
msgid "A quick way to invert the order of the gradient."
msgstr "Rýchly spôsob invertovanie poradia prechodu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:283
#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:300
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Zastaviť"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:284
msgid "Choose a color for the current selected stop."
msgstr "Vyberte farbu pre aktuálne vybrané zastavenie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:286
msgid "Gradient"
msgstr "Prechod"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:286
msgid "Choose the opacity for the current selected stop."
msgstr "Vyberte nepriehľadnosť pre aktuálne vybrané zastavenie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:290
msgid ""
"When a stop triangle is selected, it is highlighted with a slight blue "
"outline. The selected stop triangle will change its color and opacity "
"accordingly when these options are changed."
msgstr ""
"Keď je vybratý trojuholník zastavenia, je zvýraznený slabým modrým obrysom. "
"Vybraný trojuholník zastavenia zmení svoju farbu a nepriehľadnosť podľa "
"toho, keď sa tieto možnosti zmenia."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:294
msgid ""
"You can edit the gradient in two ways. The first one is the actual gradient "
"in the docker that you can manipulate. Vectors always use stop-gradients. "
"The other way to edit gradients is editing their position on the canvas."
msgstr ""
"Prechod môžete upravovať dvoma spôsobmi. Prvý je samotný prechod v dockeri, "
"s ktorým môžete manipulovať. Vektory vždy používajú stop-prechody. Druhý "
"spôsob úpravy prechodov je úprava ich polohy na plátne."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:298
msgid "Fills the shape with a Mesh Gradient. It has following options:"
msgstr "Vypĺňa tvar mriežkovým prechodom. Má nasledujúce možnosti:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:301
msgid ""
"Change the color of the selected stop. Only the color of a Corner can be "
"changed (rectangle), changing the color of Bezier handle (circle) is not "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Zmena farby vybraného zastavenia. Zmeniť možno len farbu rohu (obdĺžnik), "
"zmena farby Bezierovho úchytu (kruh) nie je možná."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:302
msgid "Rows"
msgstr "Riadky"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:303
msgid "Change the number of rows in a Mesh Gradient."
msgstr "Zmena počtu riadkov v mriežkovom prechode."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:304
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "Stĺpce"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:305
msgid "Change the number of columns in a Mesh Gradient."
msgstr "Zmena počtu stĺpcov v mriežkovom prechode."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:307
msgid "Mesh Gradient"
msgstr "Prechod siete"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:307
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Plynulý"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:307
msgid ""
"There are two possible values, *Bilinear* (default) and *Bicubic*. "
"*Bilinear* is the linear interpolation of the color of stops, however it may "
"create `Mach Banding effect <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mach_bands>`_. "
"*Bicubic* is the bicubic interpolation of the color stops, this should "
"produce smoother gradient."
msgstr ""
"Existujú dve možné hodnoty, *Bilinear* (predvolené) a *Bicubic*. *Bilinear* "
"je lineárna interpolácia farby zastavení, môže však vytvoriť `efekt "
"Machových pásov <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mach_bands>`_. *Bicubic* je "
"bikubická interpolácia zastavení farieb, čo by malo produkovať plynulejší "
"prechod."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:311
msgid ""
"Mesh Gradients follow `SVG draft 2 <https://svgwg.org/svg-next/pservers."
"html#MeshGradients>`_ for the rendering."
msgstr ""
"Mriežkové prechody sa pri vykresľovaní riadia `návrhom SVG 2 <https://svgwg."
"org/svg-next/pservers.html#MeshGradients>`_."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:314
msgid "Creating Mesh Gradients"
msgstr "Prechod"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:316
msgid ""
"When Mesh Gradients option is selected for a shape, Krita fills it with "
"default mesh gradient, which is an alternating color (it alternates between "
"background color and white). Changing number of rows and columns from Tool "
"Options, will add more patches to the Mesh Gradient and corners can be "
"changed individually."
msgstr ""
"Keď je pre tvar vybraná možnosť Mriežkový prechod, Krita ho vyplní "
"predvoleným mriežkovým prechodom, čo je striedajúca sa farba (striedajú sa "
"farba pozadia a biela). Zmenou počtu riadkov a stĺpcov v Možnostiach "
"nástroja sa pridajú ďalšie záplaty do mriežkového prechodu a rohy možno "
"meniť jednotlivo."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:319
msgid "Editing Mesh Gradients"
msgstr "Úprava mriežkových prechodov"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:321
msgid ""
"The way to edit Mesh Gradients is pretty straight forward. Each curve is an "
"individual Bezier Curve. There are two ways to change the structure, one is "
"by dragging the corner (rectangle) and other is by dragging the handle "
"(circle)."
msgstr ""
"Spôsob úpravy mriežkových prechodov je pomerne priamočiary. Každá krivka je "
"samostatná Bezierova krivka. Existujú dva spôsoby zmeny štruktúry: ťahaním "
"rohu (obdĺžnik) alebo ťahaním úchytu (kruh)."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:327
msgid "Left to right: Normal, Corner Hovered, Corner Moved and Selected."
msgstr "Zľava doprava: Normal, Corner Hovered, Corner Moved a Selected."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:327
msgid ".. image:: /images/tools/MeshGradients-corner-moving.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/tools/MeshGradients-corner-moving.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:329
msgid ""
"To change the color, a corner has to be selected and then Tool Options can "
"be used to change the color of the selected corner."
msgstr ""
"Na zmenu farby musí byť vybratý roh a potom možno pomocou Možností nástroja "
"zmeniť farbu vybraného rohu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:333
msgid ""
"When importing from Inkscape, shapes may be grouped, which may not allow "
"Krita to edit Mesh Gradients. To fix this, first ungroup (via |mouseright|) "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Pri importe z Inkscape môžu byť tvary zoskupené, čo nemusí umožniť Kritovi "
"upravovať mriežkové prechody. Ak to chcete opraviť, najprv ich odoskupte "
"(cez |mouseright|)."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:338
msgid "Right-click menu"
msgstr "Ponuka pravého tlačidla"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:340
msgid ""
"The shape selection tool has a nice right click menu that gives you several "
"features. If you have an object selected, you can perform various functions "
"like cutting, copying, or moving the object to the front or back."
msgstr ""
"Nástroj na výber tvarov má užitočné kontextové menu (pravé tlačidlo myši), "
"ktoré ponúka niekoľko funkcií. Ak máte vybraný objekt, môžete vykonávať "
"rôzne funkcie, ako je vystrihnutie, kopírovanie alebo presunutie objektu "
"dopredu alebo dozadu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:343
msgid ".. image:: /images/vector/Vector-right-click-menu.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/vector/Vector-right-click-menu.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:344
msgid ""
"If you have multiple objects selected you can perform \"Logical Operators\" "
"on them, or boolean operations as they are commonly called. It will be the "
"last item on the right-click menu. You can unite, intersect, subtract, or "
"split the selected objects."
msgstr ""
"Ak máte vybrané viacero objektov, môžete na ne aplikovať „Logické operátory"
"\", alebo tzv. booleovské operácie. Bude to posledná položka v kontextovom "
"menu. Vybrané objekty môžete zjednocovať, pretínať, odčítavať alebo "
"rozdeľovať."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:349
msgid "Shape Selection Text Options"
msgstr "Výber"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:351
msgid ""
"When text shapes are selected, their paragraph properties can be edited all "
"at once with the :ref:`text_properties_docker`. Beyond that, there's a "
"number of extra actions available:"
msgstr ""
"Keď sú vybrané textové tvary, ich vlastnosti odstavca možno naraz upraviť "
"pomocou :ref:`text_properties_docker`. Okrem toho je k dispozícii množstvo "
"ďalších akcií:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:353
msgid "Convert..."
msgstr "Konvertovať..."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:354
msgid "See :ref:`text_type` for more information."
msgstr "Viac informácií nájdete v :ref:`text_type`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:355
msgid "Flow Text in Shape"
msgstr "Tvar textu"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:356
msgid ""
"Flows the first selected text into all the selected shapes. The visual order "
"determines the initial text flow order."
msgstr ""
"Vloží prvý vybraný text do všetkých vybraných tvarov. Vizuálne poradie "
"určuje počiatočné poradie toku textu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:357
msgid "Subtract Shape from Text Flow Area"
msgstr "Odčítať tvar z oblasti toku textu"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:358
msgid ""
"Adds all selected shapes to the first selected text shape as subtraction "
"areas. See :ref:`text_in_shape` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Pridá všetky vybrané tvary k prvému vybranému textovému tvaru ako oblasti "
"odčítania. Viac informácií nájdete v :ref:`text_in_shape`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:360
msgid "Put Text On Path"
msgstr "Text na ceste"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:360
msgid ""
"Puts the whole text on the first selected path. This function will replace "
"any pre-existing paths."
msgstr ""
"Umiestni celý text na prvú vybratú cestu. Táto funkcia nahradí všetky "
"predchádzajúce cesty."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:362
msgid ""
"When a :ref:`text_in_shape` is selected, a button appears in the top right. "
"Clicking this will switch the tool into text contour mode. In this mode you "
"can select, move, scale and rotate the shapes that belong with a text. It is "
"also available in the :ref:`shape_edit_tool`, but automatically disables in "
"the :ref:`text_tool`. When in this mode, the text properties docker will "
"edit the text regardless of what is selected."
msgstr ""
"Keď je vybraný :ref:`text_in_shape`, v pravom hornom rohu sa zobrazí "
"tlačidlo. Kliknutím naň sa nástroj prepne do režimu obrysu textu. V tomto "
"režime môžete vyberať, presúvať, škálovať a otáčať tvary patriace k textu. "
"Je dostupný aj v :ref:`shape_edit_tool`, ale automaticky sa deaktivuje v :"
"ref:`text_tool`. V tomto režime bude docker vlastností textu upravovať text "
"bez ohľadu na to, čo je vybraté."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:364
msgid ""
"A number of extra actions become available in the right click menu when in "
"the text contour mode:"
msgstr ""
"V režime obrysu textu sa v kontextovom menu sprístupní množstvo ďalších "
"akcií:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:366
msgid "Remove Shapes from Text Flow"
msgstr "Odstrániť tvary z toku textu"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:367
msgid "Remove all selected shapes from the current text."
msgstr "Odstrániť všetky vybrané tvary z aktuálneho textu."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:368
msgid "Toggle Flow Shape Type"
msgstr "Prepínať typ tvaru toku"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:369
msgid "Switches the shape type between Subtract and Inside."
msgstr "Prepína typ tvaru medzi Subtract a Inside."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:370
msgid "Set Flow Shape as Last"
msgstr "Nastaviť tvar toku ako posledný"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:371
msgid "Make this flow shape the last in the text chain as used by text layout."
msgstr ""
"Make this flow shape the last in the text chain as used by text layout."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:372
msgid "Earlier In Chain"
msgstr "Skôr v reťazci"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:373
msgid "Move this shape earlier in the text chain."
msgstr "Presunúť tento tvar skôr v textovej reťazi."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:374
msgid "Later In Chain"
msgstr "Neskôr v reťazi"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:375
msgid "Move this shape later in the text chain."
msgstr "Presunúť tento tvar neskôr v textovej reťazi."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:377
msgid ""
"Make this flow shape the first in the text chain as used by text layout."
msgstr ""
"Make this flow shape the first in the text chain as used by text layout."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/shape_selection.rst:378
msgid "First In Chain"
msgstr "Odsadenie prvého riadku"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid "toolgradient"
#~ msgstr "Prechod"

#~ msgid "Patterns"
